	(text "CDX Rev E / 2026-11-08: prototype additions\nP0.20 (U1 pin44) -> R7 2.2k -> D1 KT-0603R red -> GND. Active high.\nUSB outline unchanged. (Prototype test pads TP1-TP20 were removed in the fable revision.)" (at 270 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6b6ec790-0e19-4953-af22-f795413c852c"))
	(text "Rev E: P0.20 -> DBG_LED (was NC)" (at 106.68 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "b998e270-4296-4f34-b7b3-6cf5a10ecd56"))
	(text "FABLE Rev F / 2026-11-22: battery connector J8 back to JST PH 2P (S2B-PH-K, THT), on the right edge of the MCU board\nRev E: battery board removed from this PCB (made with the keyboard PCB); kept here in the schematic\nRev D: battery board holds 2x AAA in series (MYOUNG SMD clips BT1-BT4, J5 removed)\nRev C: battery board split off the MCU board\nBattery board: 2x AAA (BT1-BT4) -> F1 -> SW2 -> J9 (SH 2P). MCU board: J8 (PH 2P) -> Q1 (reverse polarity).\nCable J9-J8: 1 = BATT_SW -> VBAT_IN, 2 = BATT_GND -> GND (same idea as J4-J2 for the USB board).\nRev B: compact layout, M1.4 holes. Rev A: FPC pins J6-20 = P1.09, J7-3 = P0.13, J7-5 = P0.17;\nJ3 (SWD) 1.27 mm pitch unpopulated header; all PCB test pads removed. See CHANGES-fable.md." (at 20 275 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "3f0a6c1e-7b52-4d0e-9a61-fab1e0000001"))
